# Coding Style

## High-Level Guidelines

- Use tabs expanded to 4 spaces for indentation.
- Use PascalCase or camelCase naming conventions as appropriate.
- Refer to the following example files for detailed style guidance:
    - CodingStyle.cc
    - CodingStyle.h
    - CodingStyle.qml